<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #222; max-width: 640px;">
    <p>Dear {{data.teName}},</p>

    <p>The request for BG creation has been accepted and the BG has been created.</p>

    <p>
        {{#if data.hasSignedCoveringLetter}}Signed Covering Letter: attached below<br>{{/if}}
        {{#if data.hasSoftCopy}}Soft copy of the BG: attached below<br>{{/if}}
        {{#if data.courierRequestNo}}Courier Request No.: {{data.courierRequestNo}}<br>{{/if}}
        SFMS Confirmation of the BG will be sent in the next mail.{{#if data.remarks}}<br>
        Remarks: {{data.remarks}}{{/if}}
    </p>

    <p>
        Regards,<br>
        Imran Khan,<br>
        Accounts team.
    </p>

    {{#if data.attachmentNames.length}}
    <p>
        Attachment:<br>
        {{#each data.attachmentNames}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}<br>{{/unless}}{{/each}}
    </p>
    {{/if}}
</div>
